3. This is an application seeking to quash criminal prosecution, namely, Special Case No.288/2022 arising out of Crime No.770/2022, registered with Police Station Gadge Nagar, District Amravati,
for the offence punishable under Sections 323, 506(2), 504, 376(2)(n) of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 4, 8, 12 of the Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act, 2012 and Sections 3(1)(r),
3(1)(s), 3(1)(w)(i), 3(1)(w)(ii), 3(2)(v), 3(2)(va) and 3(2) (7) of the Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes (Prevention of Atrocities) Act, 1989 on merits as well as settlement.
